{"101338":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/101338-Rl54Qhx71dUq.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#50e4f1","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx101338-rokVscjRYzdP.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx101338-rokVscjRYzdP.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx101338-rokVscjRYzdP.jpg"},"description":"The second season of \u003ci\u003eMob Psycho 100\u003c/i\u003e. \u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003eKageyama is an ordinary 8th grader who just wants to live a normal life. Although he can disappear in the crowd in a flash, he was actually the most powerful psychic. The lives of those around Mob and his numerous feelings that softly piles up for the eventual explosion. The mysterious group \"Claw\" stands before him once again. In the midst of his youthful days, where will his roaring heart take him!?\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Crunchyroll)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":1,"month":4,"year":2019},"episodes":13,"format":"TV","genres":["Action","Comedy","Drama","Psychological","Slice of Life","Supernatural"],"id":101338,"idMal":37510,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":87,"season":"WINTER","seasonYear":2019,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/101338","startDate":{"day":7,"month":1,"year":2019},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["Mob Psycho Hyaku","ม็อบไซโค 100 คนพลังจิต ภาค 2","Моб Психо 100 II"],"title":{"english":"Mob Psycho 100 II","native":"モブサイコ100 II","romaji":"Mob Psycho 100 II","userPreferred":"Mob Psycho 100 II"},"trailer":{"id":"Pr43Sayk37s","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Pr43Sayk37s/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T01:47:34.510498393+05:30"},"102976":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/102976-xv7fCzBwQ7GU.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#50bbe4","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx102976-2Yi5icRbjukO.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx102976-2Yi5icRbjukO.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx102976-2Yi5icRbjukO.png"},"description":"A video game-loving shut-in, Satou Kazuma's life should've ended when he was hit by a truck, but through a twist of fate, he ends up reincarnating in another world--and dragging the troublemaking goddess, Aqua, the wildly dorky mage, Megumin, and the unrelentingly delusional lady knight, Darkness, with him.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\nNow, the Crimson Demon village that Megumin and Yunyun are from is facing a threat that could mean its ending. Kazuma and his gang follow Yunyun, who returns to the Crimson Demon village intent on saving it... when they are faced with their greatest threat yet! What will become of the unremarkable adventurer Kazuma's life in another world?!\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Crunchyroll)","duration":90,"endDate":{"day":30,"month":8,"year":2019},"episodes":1,"format":"MOVIE","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Ecchi","Fantasy","Supernatural"],"id":102976,"idMal":38040,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":82,"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2019,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/102976","startDate":{"day":30,"month":8,"year":2019},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["Konosuba Movie","このすば紅伝説","ขอให้โชคดีมีชัยในโลกแฟนตาซี เดอะ มูฟวี่ ตำนานสีชาด","Konosuba! Un mundo maravilloso. La leyenda del carmesí"],"title":{"english":"KONOSUBA -God's blessing on this wonderful world!- Legend of Crimson","native":"この素晴らしい世界に祝福を！紅伝説","romaji":"Kono Subarashii Sekai ni Shukufuku wo! Kurenai Densetsu","userPreferred":"KONOSUBA -God's blessing on this wonderful world!- Legend of Crimson"},"trailer":{"id":"5h4rQY9bpgE","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/5h4rQY9bpgE/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T02:26:44.427550161+05:30"},"106509":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/106509-LWc69en5SVn9.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#a1c9e4","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx106509-nTJyMJKbvRFn.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx106509-nTJyMJKbvRFn.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx106509-nTJyMJKbvRFn.jpg"},"description":"\u003cstrong\u003eOVA 1:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nIn the midst of his everyday life, Rimuru suddenly realizes that there's nothing to do for recreation in Tempest. He suggests sumo wrestling as a way for everyone to have fun together, and his friends are immediately on board with the idea. Thus begins Tempest's first sumo tournament, in which everyone competes enthusiastically in hopes of winning the grand prize! Passionate contests break out not only among Benimaru and the men, but also among women like Shuna and Shion, and even Rimuru ends up joining in!\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOVA 2:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nOne day, Shuna and Shion are fighting over Rimuru's squishy slime body as usual. Rimuru figures that giving them each a body double of himself would solve the conflict, but when he imagines some of his other friends asking him to do the same for them, he quickly drops that plan. Then he comes up with the idea to make a cushion in the shape of his slime form. He travels around Tempest to see if his friends know of any good materials he can use, and he learns that a special type of sand found along a lakeshore in the forest is exactly what he's looking for. So he sets out to collect some sand... but a monster is waiting for him by the lake! What's more, Milim hears about his plan for a picnic and comes racing down from the sky!\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOVA 3-5:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nRimuru, now a teacher at the Freedom Academy in the Kingdom of Ingrassia, has become involved in the school's outdoor training event with his class. The outdoor training event is an annual competition in which the students of each class guard the teachers on a journey to a nearby town. Rimuru is assigned to Class A, while his own students in Class S escort the young Tiss-sensei. All the students are eager to show how much their daily training has paid off, but the situation turns around when they're attacked by thieves!\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Crunchyroll)\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003ci\u003eNote: Bundled with the limited edition of the 12th-16th manga volumes.\u003c/i\u003e","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":27,"month":11,"year":2020},"episodes":5,"format":"OVA","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Ecchi","Fantasy"],"id":106509,"idMal":38793,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":73,"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2019,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/106509","startDate":{"day":9,"month":7,"year":2019},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["ten·sura","転スラ","Tensei Shitara Slime Datta Ken (2019)","That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime OVA","เกิดใหม่ทั้งทีก็เป็นสไลม์ไปซะแล้ว OAD","Moi, quand je me réincarne en Slime OAD"],"title":{"english":"That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime OAD","native":"転生したらスライムだった件 OVA","romaji":"Tensei Shitara Slime Datta Ken OVA","userPreferred":"That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime OAD"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T02:17:54.48800794+05:30"},"110277":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/110277-iuGn6F5bK1U1.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#ae6b35","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx110277-sKUNXAsWMNFw.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx110277-sKUNXAsWMNFw.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx110277-sKUNXAsWMNFw.jpg"},"description":"It’s been four years since the Scout Regiment reached the shoreline, and the world looks different now. Things are heating up as the fate of the Scout Regiment—and the people of Paradis—are determined at last. However, Eren is missing. Will he reappear before age-old tensions between Marleyans and Eldians result in the war of all wars?\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Crunchyroll)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":29,"month":3,"year":2021},"episodes":16,"format":"TV","genres":["Action","Drama","Fantasy","Mystery"],"id":110277,"idMal":40028,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":87,"season":"WINTER","seasonYear":2021,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/110277","startDate":{"day":7,"month":12,"year":2020},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["SnK 4","AoT 4","Shingeki no Kyojin 4","進撃の巨人4","Attack on Titan Season 4","진격의 거인 더 파이널 시즌","מתקפת הטיטאנים העונה האחרונה","L'Attaque des Titans Saison Finale","L'Attacco dei Giganti 4","L'Attacco dei Giganti - La Stagione Finale","حمله به تایتان فصل 4 "," ผ่าพิภพไททัน ไฟนอล ซีซั่น","ผ่าพิภพไททัน Final Season","ผ่าพิภพไททัน ภาค 4","هجوم العملاقة الجزء الأخير","Атака Титанов: Финал"],"title":{"english":"Attack on Titan Final Season","native":"進撃の巨人 The Final Season","romaji":"Shingeki no Kyojin: The Final Season","userPreferred":"Attack on Titan Final Season"},"trailer":{"id":"MUCN-JwUvbY","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/MUCN-JwUvbY/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T01:53:37.289337487+05:30"},"113024":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/113024-gjxwISIts05f.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e45d50","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx113024-OdzOh0OKFPTN.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx113024-OdzOh0OKFPTN.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx113024-OdzOh0OKFPTN.png"},"description":"The stage emulates life and compresses it, setting free skills learned over lifetimes in brief but dazzling displays for the amusement and judgment of others. For the performers, it is the ultimate risk, and some will rise while others must fall. Nowhere is this truer than at the Seisho Music Academy, where music, dance and real weapons all come into play in the creation of the next great Star. Karen and Hikari’s destinies have been linked since a childhood promise, but their journeys here have taken very different paths. Now, after Hikari leaves, Karen must discover who she is without her opposite, while Hikari must rediscover her own course.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)","duration":120,"endDate":{"day":4,"month":6,"year":2021},"episodes":1,"format":"MOVIE","genres":["Action","Drama","Music","Psychological"],"id":113024,"idMal":40664,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":87,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2021,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/113024","startDate":{"day":4,"month":6,"year":2021},"status":"FINISHED","title":{"english":"Revue Starlight: The Movie","native":"劇場版 少女☆歌劇 レヴュースタァライト","romaji":"Shoujo☆Kageki Revue Starlight Movie","userPreferred":"Revue Starlight: The Movie"},"trailer":{"id":"576xjJdDBNg","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/576xjJdDBNg/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T01:47:29.769833263+05:30"},"1219":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1219-093hKDC7vZnq.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e4a15d","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx1219-z03GReWrvUM8.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx1219-z03GReWrvUM8.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx1219-z03GReWrvUM8.png"},"description":"Haruma Kawagoe is an only child. A long time ago, at Christmas time, his mother miscarried the child that was to have been his baby sister. That night, young Haruma knelt down and offered up an earnest prayer: \"Please make my mother well again, and please give me a little sister.\" Years have passed, and Haruma has nearly forgotten his prayer. But Santa hasn't.... one Christmas, when Haruma is least expecting it, he gets an unusual present - his sister.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Anime News Network)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":20,"month":12,"year":2006},"episodes":24,"format":"TV","genres":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"id":1219,"idMal":1219,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":64,"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2006,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/1219","startDate":{"day":12,"month":7,"year":2006},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["Chokotto Sister"],"title":{"native":"ちょこッとSister","romaji":"Chocotto Sister","userPreferred":"Chocotto Sister"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T01:49:40.638311115+05:30"},"122807":{"value":{"Media":{"id":122807,"idMal":42668,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/122807","status":"FINISHED","season":"FALL","type":"ANIME","format":"TV","seasonYear":2020,"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/122807-WuQXmiTg70lh.jpg","episodes":11,"synonyms":["Taiso Samurai"],"isAdult":false,"countryOfOrigin":"JP","meanScore":70,"description":"Joutarou Aragaki, former member of the national team, had given his whole life for gymnastics and was fighting against his age and physical strength. However, one day he is told by his coach to start thinking of his next career. Joutarou struggles, but his daughter, Rei, is always there by his side. But with one fateful encounter, the Aragakis’ lives change drastically.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Funimation)\n","genres":["Drama","Sports"],"duration":23,"trailer":{"id":"KSdkglUr7oc","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/KSdkglUr7oc/hqdefault.jpg"},"title":{"english":"The Gymnastics Samurai","native":"体操ザムライ","romaji":"Taisou Zamurai","userPreferred":"The Gymnastics Samurai"},"coverImage":{"color":"#e4a128","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx122807-m8jdQLQRSSUI.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx122807-m8jdQLQRSSUI.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx122807-m8jdQLQRSSUI.jpg"},"startDate":{"day":11,"month":10,"year":2020},"endDate":{"day":20,"month":12,"year":2020}}},"updated_at":"2026-07-12T02:20:13.441143686+05:30"},"124223":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/124223-BY20WcVyVHEA.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#5d93e4","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx124223-XMOEUPopjtrI.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx124223-XMOEUPopjtrI.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx124223-XMOEUPopjtrI.png"},"description":"The second season of \u003ci\u003eUma Musume: Pretty Derby\u003c/i\u003e.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nAll eyes are on Toukai Teiou as she takes on the Japanese Derby, ready to gallop in Symboli Rudolf's footsteps and become an undefeated Triple Crown Horse Girl. The stands are full. The track is set. It's time to see which horse girl fortune favors!\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Crunchyroll, edited)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":30,"month":3,"year":2021},"episodes":13,"format":"TV","genres":["Drama","Slice of Life","Sports"],"id":124223,"idMal":42941,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":83,"season":"WINTER","seasonYear":2021,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/124223","startDate":{"day":5,"month":1,"year":2021},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["สาวม้าโมเอะ ภาค 2"],"title":{"english":"Umamusume: Pretty Derby Season 2","native":"ウマ娘 プリティーダービー Season 2","romaji":"Uma Musume: Pretty Derby Season 2","userPreferred":"Umamusume: Pretty Derby Season 2"},"trailer":{"id":"1y77CeQmnD8","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/1y77CeQmnD8/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T02:27:12.895357484+05:30"},"125368":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/125368-zCY0WnSQl7RG.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#c97843","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx125368-QhcBkbNP0ZfU.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx125368-QhcBkbNP0ZfU.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx125368-QhcBkbNP0ZfU.png"},"description":"OVA adapting both chapters of \u003ci\u003eKaguya-sama wa Kokurasetai Darkness\u003c/i\u003e and Chapter 96 of the main series.","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":19,"month":5,"year":2021},"episodes":1,"format":"OVA","genres":["Comedy","Ecchi","Romance","Slice of Life"],"id":125368,"idMal":43609,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":75,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2021,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/125368","startDate":{"day":19,"month":5,"year":2021},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["Kaguya-sama: Love is War OVA","Kaguya-sama wa Kokurasetai: Tensai-tachi no Renai Zunousen OVA"],"title":{"native":"かぐや様は告らせたい～天才たちの恋愛頭脳戦～OVA","romaji":"Kaguya-sama wa Kokurasetai: Tensaitachi no Renai Zunousen OVA","userPreferred":"Kaguya-sama wa Kokurasetai: Tensaitachi no Renai Zunousen OVA"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T02:26:43.841270298+05:30"},"132405":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/132405-LnPQaqaksEpN.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e46b5d","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx132405-qP7FQYGmNI3d.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx132405-qP7FQYGmNI3d.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx132405-qP7FQYGmNI3d.jpg"},"description":"High schooler Wakana Gojou cares about one thing: making Hina dolls. With nobody to share his obsession, he has trouble finding friends—or even holding conversation. But after the school’s most popular girl, Marin Kitagawa, reveals a secret of her own, he discovers a new purpose for his sewing skills. Together, they’ll make her cosplay dreams come true! \u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Funimation)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":27,"month":3,"year":2022},"episodes":12,"format":"TV","genres":["Comedy","Ecchi","Romance","Slice of Life"],"id":132405,"idMal":48736,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":80,"season":"WINTER","seasonYear":2022,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/132405","startDate":{"day":9,"month":1,"year":2022},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["Sono Kisekae Ningyou wa Koi wo suru","หนุ่มเย็บผ้ากับสาวนักคอสเพลย์","その着せ替え人形（ビスク・ドール）は恋をする","kisekoi","Si Boneka Rias Sedang Jatuh Cinta","Projekt: cosplay","Любовь с иголочки","着せ恋","Oyuncak Bebek Sevgilim","Nàng Búp Bê Thử Đồ Biết Yêu"],"title":{"english":"My Dress-Up Darling","native":"その着せ替え人形は恋をする","romaji":"Sono Bisque Doll wa Koi wo Suru","userPreferred":"My Dress-Up Darling"},"trailer":{"id":"8oveGY6h6T8","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/8oveGY6h6T8/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T01:55:58.353273488+05:30"},"13469":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n13469-4SXZGXqQSsdp.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e4e493","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx13469-bbRQoSUgmf4T.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx13469-bbRQoSUgmf4T.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx13469-bbRQoSUgmf4T.png"},"description":"\u003ci\u003eWas bundled with the third volume of the manga.\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\nIt's another regular day, with Houtarou Oreki sitting at home as usual; that is until his sister Tomoe ropes him into working as a lifeguard at the local swimming pool. Upon reaching the pool, Oreki coincidentally meets the other members of the Classics Club. Eru Chitanda notices that a white object that was on a woman's ear a while ago suddenly disappeared, which leaves her curious about the mystery behind it.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\nHyouka: Motsubeki Mono wa features Oreki and the rest of the Classics Club as they have fun at the pool and solve the mystery that has piqued Chitanda's curiosity.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)","duration":25,"endDate":{"day":8,"month":7,"year":2012},"episodes":1,"format":"OVA","genres":["Mystery","Slice of Life"],"id":13469,"idMal":13469,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":72,"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2012,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/13469","startDate":{"day":8,"month":7,"year":2012},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["Hyouka Episode 11.5","Hyouka OVA","Hyou-ka OVA","Hyouka: You can't escape OVA"],"title":{"english":"Hyouka: What Should Be Had","native":"氷菓 持つべきものは","romaji":"Hyouka: Motsubeki Mono wa","userPreferred":"Hyouka: What Should Be Had"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T01:48:52.611416589+05:30"},"140439":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/140439-r9SRh0q0UgX1.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#28c9fe","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx140439-bPKmhe1wNxc9.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx140439-bPKmhe1wNxc9.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx140439-bPKmhe1wNxc9.jpg"},"description":"The third season of \u003ci\u003eMob Psycho 100\u003c/i\u003e. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nThe appearance of a divine tree and new religion turns Mob and Reigen's city upside down!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Crunchyroll)\n","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":22,"month":12,"year":2022},"episodes":12,"format":"TV","genres":["Action","Comedy","Drama","Psychological","Slice of Life","Supernatural"],"id":140439,"idMal":50172,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":87,"season":"FALL","seasonYear":2022,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/140439","startDate":{"day":6,"month":10,"year":2022},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["モブサイコ100 III","ม็อบไซโค 100 คนพลังจิต ภาค 3","Моб Психо 100 III"],"title":{"english":"Mob Psycho 100 III","native":"モブサイコ100 Ⅲ","romaji":"Mob Psycho 100 III","userPreferred":"Mob Psycho 100 III"},"trailer":{"id":"Ah7lTT-NKMw","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Ah7lTT-NKMw/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T01:47:23.518717609+05:30"},"141949":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/141949-37BoBF129jLT.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#d6e45d","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx141949-tViCIRHPZAyG.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx141949-tViCIRHPZAyG.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx141949-tViCIRHPZAyG.jpg"},"description":"Third-year high school student Jirou Yakuin hoped to partner with Shiori Sakurazaka of the same class in the mandatory \"Couple Practical\" course. In this practical, students must demonstrate that they have the necessary skillset to live with a partner of the opposite sex while presenting a certain level of harmony to the video surveillance that grades them.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\nUnfortunately, random chance put his slightly subdued self into the practical with the person polar opposite to him, the gyaru Akari Watanabe. Akari on the other hand hoped to be paired with her crush Minami Tenjin.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\nTheir hopes are doubly dashed when they find out that Shiori and Minami are assigned together. Thus, they reluctantly decide to cooperate to reach the top ten, which would give them the right to exchange partners if both couples agree. To that end, Jirou steals Akari's first kiss without realizing what he'd done, while giving a hurried good-bye kiss...","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":25,"month":12,"year":2022},"episodes":12,"format":"TV","genres":["Comedy","Drama","Ecchi","Romance"],"id":141949,"idMal":50425,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":76,"season":"FALL","seasonYear":2022,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/141949","startDate":{"day":9,"month":10,"year":2022},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["More than a Couple, Less than Lovers.","แผนสมรสไม่สมเลิฟ","Presque mariés, loin d'être amoureux.","Больше чем пара, меньше чем любовники","Fuukoi","ふうこい"],"title":{"english":"More than a Married Couple, but Not Lovers.","native":"夫婦以上、恋人未満。","romaji":"Fuufu Ijou, Koibito Miman.","userPreferred":"More than a Married Couple, but Not Lovers."},"trailer":{"id":"2gHhxAksU9E","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/2gHhxAksU9E/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T02:53:44.412844508+05:30"},"146065":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/146065-33RDijfuxLLk.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#35aee4","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx146065-IjirxRK26O03.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx146065-IjirxRK26O03.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx146065-IjirxRK26O03.png"},"description":"After his relationship with Eris Boreas Greyrat reaches new heights, Rudeus Greyrat is ecstatic. Unfortunately, his joy is short-lived, as Eris suddenly abandons him to embark on her own journey. Believing that Eris has lost all interest in him, a heartbroken and depressed Rudeus sets forth to the Northern Territories. With his sole goal being to locate his mother on the vast continent, Rudeus wonders if persisting through daily life is worth the pain, falling into a robotic routine as he endlessly ruminates on his lost love.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nHowever, the dangers of the North soon prove that one cannot survive with a dulled mind. While on a quest with the party Counter Arrow, with whom he recently became acquainted, Rudeus has a brush with death—an experience that forces him to finally snap out of his despair. With his newfound teammates, Rudeus rediscovers the pleasure of daily adventuring and moves forward with his original goal of living his second lease on life to the fullest.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003ci\u003eNote: Includes episode 0, Shugo Jutsushi Fitz.\u003c/i\u003e","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":25,"month":9,"year":2023},"episodes":13,"format":"TV","genres":["Adventure","Drama","Ecchi","Fantasy"],"id":146065,"idMal":51179,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":81,"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2023,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/146065","startDate":{"day":3,"month":7,"year":2023},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["เกิดชาตินี้พี่ต้องเทพ ซีซั่น 2","Mushoku Tensei: Isekai Ittara Honki Dasu 2nd Season","Mushoku Tensei II: Jobless Reincarnation","Mushoku Tensei II: Reencarnación desde cero","无职转生～到了异世界就拿出真本事～第2季"],"title":{"english":"Mushoku Tensei: Jobless Reincarnation Season 2","native":"無職転生Ⅱ ～異世界行ったら本気だす～","romaji":"Mushoku Tensei II: Isekai Ittara Honki Dasu","userPreferred":"Mushoku Tensei: Jobless Reincarnation Season 2"},"trailer":{"id":"ts5NGoDI1V0","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ts5NGoDI1V0/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T01:53:51.664251471+05:30"},"147105":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/147105-fTjmRrILFixZ.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#0d8693","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx147105-rwOX8qyUy8gV.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx147105-rwOX8qyUy8gV.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx147105-rwOX8qyUy8gV.jpg"},"description":"In a world where everyone takes wonders like magic spells and dragons for granted, Coco is a girl with a simple dream: she wants to be a witch. But everybody knows magicians are born, not made, and Coco was not born with a gift for magic. Resigned to her un-magical life, Coco is about to give up on her dream to become a witch … until the day she meets Qifrey, a mysterious, traveling magician. After secretly seeing Qifrey perform magic in a way she’s never seen before, Coco soon learns what everybody “knows” might not be the truth, and discovers that her magical dream may not be as far away as it may seem... \u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Kodansha USA) \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\n\u003ci\u003eNote: Tongari Boushi no Atelier episode 2 was streamed a week in advance on Crunchyroll, ABEMA, and Netflix, alongside episode 1. Streaming is one week ahead of the TV broadcast.\u003c/i\u003e","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":22,"month":6,"year":2026},"episodes":13,"format":"ONA","genres":["Adventure","Drama","Fantasy"],"id":147105,"idMal":51553,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":86,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2026,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/147105","startDate":{"day":6,"month":4,"year":2026},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["Atelier of Witch Hat"," จอมเวทฝึกหัดกับหมวกมหัศจรรย์","Atelier spiczastych kapeluszy","Cadı Şapkası Atölyesi","L'Atelier des Sorciers","Xưởng Phép Thuật","Ателье колдовских колпаков"],"title":{"english":"Witch Hat Atelier","native":"とんがり帽子のアトリエ","romaji":"Tongari Boushi no Atelier","userPreferred":"Witch Hat Atelier"},"trailer":{"id":"rc26AwBXlUE","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/rc26AwBXlUE/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-22T19:53:46.025430165+05:30"},"15417":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/15417-0T9JCwFZM99Q.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#50aed6","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx15417-Uc2uNdWEixwi.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx15417-Uc2uNdWEixwi.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx15417-Uc2uNdWEixwi.jpg"},"description":"While Gintoki Sakata was away, the Yorozuya found themselves a new leader: Kintoki, Gintoki's golden-haired doppelganger. In order to regain his former position, Gintoki will need the help of those around him, a troubling feat when no one can remember him! Between Kintoki and Gintoki, who will claim the throne as the main character?\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nIn addition, Yorozuya make a trip back down to red-light district of Yoshiwara to aid an elderly courtesan in her search for her long-lost lover. Although the district is no longer in chains beneath the earth's surface, the trio soon learn of the tragic backstories of Yoshiwara's inhabitants that still haunt them. With flashback after flashback, this quest has Yorozuya witnessing everlasting love and protecting it as best they can with their hearts and souls.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003ci\u003eGintama'\u003c/i\u003e: Enchousen includes moments of action-packed intensity along with their usual lighthearted, slapstick humor for Gintoki and his friends.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":28,"month":3,"year":2013},"episodes":13,"format":"TV","genres":["Action","Comedy","Drama","Sci-Fi"],"id":15417,"idMal":15417,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":89,"season":"FALL","seasonYear":2012,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/15417","startDate":{"day":4,"month":10,"year":2012},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["Gintama' (2012)","Gintama' Overdrive","Kintama"],"title":{"english":"Gintama Season 2 Part 2","native":"銀魂’延長戦","romaji":"Gintama': Enchousen","userPreferred":"Gintama Season 2 Part 2"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T01:47:42.089698921+05:30"},"158559":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/158559-plsSIyvRIiOc.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e4a150","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx158559-yCnnnedsSCie.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx158559-yCnnnedsSCie.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx158559-yCnnnedsSCie.jpg"},"description":"\u003ci\u003e“I have no interest in real girls!” \u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\nSo claims Okumura, the president of the school’s manga club. He’s your typical otaku, obsessed with a sexy (fictional) 2D manga character known as Lilliel. Then the new school year starts, and a (real!) 3D girl named Lilysa whose passion is cosplay joins the club. Lilysa convinces Okumura to become her photographer–and guess who her favorite manga character is? Not only that, but Lilysa is into modeling the fetishy stuff! The boundaries between 2D and 3D start to blur as this hot-blooded romantic comedy unfolds.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Seven Seas Entertainment)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":13,"month":12,"year":2024},"episodes":24,"format":"TV","genres":["Comedy","Ecchi","Romance","Slice of Life"],"id":158559,"idMal":53802,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":72,"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2024,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/158559","startDate":{"day":5,"month":7,"year":2024},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["2.5 Jigen no Yuuwaku","2.5 มิติ ริริสะ","Ririsa of 2.5 Dimension","にごリリ","Nigoriri","Ririsa, uma Garota em 2.5D","Ririsa, una chica en 2.5D","2.5 Seducción Dimensional"],"title":{"english":"2.5 Dimensional Seduction","native":"2.5次元の誘惑","romaji":"2.5 Jigen no Ririsa","userPreferred":"2.5 Dimensional Seduction"},"trailer":{"id":"pN8EE8d9yYE","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/pN8EE8d9yYE/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T02:26:53.952792067+05:30"},"162694":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/162694-PzaToQuFdpsr.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#28aee4","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx162694-QFBei5pbjSh8.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx162694-QFBei5pbjSh8.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx162694-QFBei5pbjSh8.png"},"description":"Rentarou Aijou was rejected 100 times in middle school. He visits a shrine and prays for better luck in high school. The God of Love appears and promises that he’ll soon meet 100 people he’s destined to date. But there’s a catch—once destiny introduces someone to him, the two must happily love each other. If they don’t, they’ll die. What will befall Rentarou and his 100 girlfriends in high school?\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Crunchyroll) ","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":24,"month":12,"year":2023},"episodes":12,"format":"TV","genres":["Comedy","Ecchi","Romance"],"id":162694,"idMal":54714,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":76,"season":"FALL","seasonYear":2023,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/162694","startDate":{"day":8,"month":10,"year":2023},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["100 Kanojo","100Kano","Hyakkano","100 Namoradas Que Te Amam Muuuuuito","Les 100 petites amies qui t'aiiiment à en mourir","100 Pacar yang Sungguh Sangat Amat Benar-benar Mencintaimu","100 девушек, которые очень-очень-очень-очень-очень сильно тебя любят","100 Cô Bạn Gái Yêu Bạn Rất Rất Rất Rất Rất Nhiều"],"title":{"english":"The 100 Girlfriends Who Really, Really, Really, Really, REALLY Love You","native":"君のことが大大大大大好きな100人の彼女","romaji":"Kimi no Koto ga Dai Dai Dai Dai Daisuki na 100-nin no Kanojo","userPreferred":"The 100 Girlfriends Who Really, Really, Really, Really, REALLY Love You"},"trailer":{"id":"ls2VNcSifi4","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ls2VNcSifi4/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T01:56:01.978415556+05:30"},"170891":{"value":{"Media":{"id":170891,"idMal":57099,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/170891","status":"FINISHED","season":"SUMMER","type":"ANIME","format":"TV","seasonYear":2024,"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/170891-4OuuElPLL20Q.jpg","episodes":12,"synonyms":["Narenare"],"isAdult":false,"countryOfOrigin":"JP","meanScore":61,"description":"Misora Kanata is a first-year student on the Takanosaki High School cheerleading team. She won a national championship in middle school, but can’t jump after a mistake in a competition. She befriends Suzuha, Shion, Anna, Nodoka, and Megumi to form the PoMPoMs. Their new team goes beyond cheerleading to reach the hearts of the people they cheer on. They might just change the world!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Crunchyroll, edited)","genres":["Drama","Slice of Life","Sports"],"duration":24,"trailer":{"id":"O2wKUAAra9E","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/O2wKUAAra9E/hqdefault.jpg"},"title":{"english":"Narenare -Cheer for you!-","native":"菜なれ花なれ","romaji":"Na-Nare Hana-Nare","userPreferred":"Narenare -Cheer for you!-"},"coverImage":{"color":"#f1e4c9","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx170891-Bhxn5y4a86Q0.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx170891-Bhxn5y4a86Q0.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx170891-Bhxn5y4a86Q0.jpg"},"startDate":{"day":7,"month":7,"year":2024},"endDate":{"day":22,"month":9,"year":2024}}},"updated_at":"2026-07-12T02:20:15.890757027+05:30"},"176246":{"value":{"Media":{"id":176246,"idMal":58492,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/176246","status":"FINISHED","season":"SPRING","type":"ANIME","format":"TV","seasonYear":2025,"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/176246-Cnm6EqDLxEN3.jpg","episodes":12,"synonyms":["mono: Weekend Animation"],"isAdult":false,"countryOfOrigin":"JP","meanScore":76,"description":"Satsuki Amamiya was feeling down due to the graduation of the high school Photography Club’s president. However, her best friend and fellow member An Kiriyama encourages Satsuki to dedicate herself to the newly merged Cinephoto Club. Join Satsuki and An as they set out to track down a missing camera, meet new faces, and capture stunning photos and videos along the way. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e (Source: Crunchyroll)","genres":["Comedy","Slice of Life"],"duration":24,"trailer":{"id":"YJzMiDd8RyM","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/YJzMiDd8RyM/hqdefault.jpg"},"title":{"english":"mono","native":"mono","romaji":"mono","userPreferred":"mono"},"coverImage":{"color":"#50bbe4","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx176246-ndH8bKh7cmzf.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx176246-ndH8bKh7cmzf.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx176246-ndH8bKh7cmzf.jpg"},"startDate":{"day":13,"month":4,"year":2025},"endDate":{"day":29,"month":6,"year":2025}}},"updated_at":"2026-07-12T02:20:16.444669431+05:30"},"180516":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/180516-qxKVBsTW6Czx.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#1aa1d6","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx180516-lebpoKLkw6E3.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx180516-lebpoKLkw6E3.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx180516-lebpoKLkw6E3.jpg"},"description":"Unbeknownst to those around her in the destitute countryside of Kasamatsu, the staggering potential of this ashen-haired \"Beast” will soon rock Japan with her feet and catapult her to the national stage—down the path of a legend. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nFollow Oguri Cap and her insatiable appetite as the starting gates open on this Umamusume's hot-blooded Cinderella story! \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\n(Source: It's Anime powered by REMOW, edited)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":29,"month":6,"year":2025},"episodes":13,"format":"TV","genres":["Drama","Sports"],"id":180516,"idMal":59636,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":85,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2025,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/180516","startDate":{"day":6,"month":4,"year":2025},"status":"FINISHED","title":{"english":"Umamusume: Cinderella Gray","native":"ウマ娘 シンデレラグレイ","romaji":"Uma Musume: Cinderella Gray","userPreferred":"Umamusume: Cinderella Gray"},"trailer":{"id":"Gw8j8-m1gVk","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Gw8j8-m1gVk/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T02:27:08.313564578+05:30"},"182205":{"value":{"Media":{"id":182205,"idMal":59970,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/182205","status":"RELEASING","season":"SPRING","type":"ANIME","format":"TV","seasonYear":2026,"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/182205-fRUoKv6f2JAq.jpg","synonyms":["Tensura 4","転スラ 4","เกิดใหม่ทั้งทีก็เป็นสไลม์ไปซะแล้ว ซีซั่น 4","О моём перерождении в слизь 4","Aquella vez que me convertí en slime - Temporada 4"],"isAdult":false,"countryOfOrigin":"JP","meanScore":82,"description":"The fourth season of \u003ci\u003eTensei Shitara Slime Datta Ken\u003c/i\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nDemon Lord Rimuru's dream of creating an alliance between humans and monsters takes a step closer to being realized. As Tempest continues to prosper, Granville Rozzo and his granddaughter, Maribel Rozzo, clash with Demon Lord Rimuru over their plan to protect mankind by ruling over them. Meanwhile, in El Dorado, Demon Lord Leon works toward goals of his own. The awakening of a new Hero draws near!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll News)","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"],"duration":24,"trailer":{"id":"ikxIrDr72iA","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ikxIrDr72iA/hqdefault.jpg"},"title":{"english":"That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime Season 4","native":"転生したらスライムだった件 第4期","romaji":"Tensei Shitara Slime Datta Ken 4th Season","userPreferred":"That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime Season 4"},"coverImage":{"color":"#1abbd6","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx182205-q2AeO1owuQbO.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx182205-q2AeO1owuQbO.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx182205-q2AeO1owuQbO.jpg"},"startDate":{"day":3,"month":4,"year":2026},"endDate":{},"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1782482400,"episode":12,"timeUntilAiring":344171}}},"updated_at":"2026-07-12T00:03:27.901482102+05:30"},"182255":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/182255-wyHvp6zJbWsO.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#5dc9f1","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx182255-butzrqd4I0aC.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx182255-butzrqd4I0aC.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx182255-butzrqd4I0aC.jpg"},"description":"The second season of \u003ci\u003eSousou no Frieren\u003c/i\u003e.","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":27,"month":3,"year":2026},"episodes":10,"format":"TV","genres":["Adventure","Drama","Fantasy"],"id":182255,"idMal":59978,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":88,"season":"WINTER","seasonYear":2026,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/182255","startDate":{"day":16,"month":1,"year":2026},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["Провожающая в последний путь Фрирен 2","장송의 프리렌 2기"],"title":{"english":"Frieren: Beyond Journey’s End Season 2","native":"葬送のフリーレン 第2期","romaji":"Sousou no Frieren 2nd Season","userPreferred":"Frieren: Beyond Journey’s End Season 2"},"trailer":{"id":"RH-FcW94z00","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/RH-FcW94z00/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T01:53:00.597154012+05:30"},"182300":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/182300-d1znfWKzn1bT.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e4a150","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx182300-IYkq5KrkQq1V.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx182300-IYkq5KrkQq1V.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx182300-IYkq5KrkQq1V.jpg"},"description":"The second season of \u003ci\u003eTsue to Tsurugi no Wistoria\u003c/i\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nWill, a washout student at a magical academy who is unable to use magic, is aiming to join the top tier of mages, the Magia Vander, to fulfill a promise to his childhood friend, Elfaria. Wielding a sword instead of a wand, his abilities are slowly recognized within the academy. During the all-student praxis dungeon training he undertakes with Lihanna and the other top students of his year, they are ambushed by a mysterious mage. Though they barely manage to survive the attack together, they go on to face the exit exam. Can Will reach the girl waiting for him in the tower?\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Official Site)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":28,"month":6,"year":2026},"episodes":12,"format":"TV","genres":["Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy"],"id":182300,"idMal":59983,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":83,"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1782631800,"episode":12,"timeUntilAiring":493577},"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2026,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/182300","startDate":{"day":12,"month":4,"year":2026},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":["ตำนานดาบและคทาแห่งวิสตอเรีย ซีซั่น 2","Tongkat Sihir dan Pedang Wistoria Season 2"],"title":{"english":"Wistoria: Wand and Sword Season 2","native":"杖と剣のウィストリア Season2","romaji":"Tsue to Tsurugi no Wistoria Season 2","userPreferred":"Wistoria: Wand and Sword Season 2"},"trailer":{"id":"57OL0uTIBVg","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/57OL0uTIBVg/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-22T19:53:43.261580795+05:30"},"182469":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/182469-obNr7bznMzN7.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e4935d","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx182469-JQ808NBPxmgn.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx182469-JQ808NBPxmgn.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx182469-JQ808NBPxmgn.jpg"},"description":"To commemorate the 25th anniversary of the \u003ci\u003eONE PIECE\u003c/i\u003e TV anime: an animated adaptation of the \"ONE PIECE novel: Mugiwara Stories\". \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\nTwo years after the Paramount War, the Straw Hats are about to reunite on the Sabaody Archipelago. At the same time, a girl who is head over heels for Nami is trying to hand a fan letter to her before the group leaves the island.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Crunchyroll)","duration":25,"endDate":{"day":20,"month":10,"year":2024},"episodes":1,"format":"SPECIAL","genres":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy"],"id":182469,"idMal":60022,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":90,"season":"FALL","seasonYear":2024,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/182469","startDate":{"day":20,"month":10,"year":2024},"status":"FINISHED","title":{"english":"ONE PIECE FAN LETTER","native":"ONE PIECE FAN LETTER","romaji":"ONE PIECE FAN LETTER","userPreferred":"ONE PIECE FAN LETTER"},"trailer":{"id":"MewJ5bEM-5U","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/MewJ5bEM-5U/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T01:47:39.294573382+05:30"},"184492":{"value":{"Media":{"id":184492,"idMal":60310,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/184492","status":"RELEASING","season":"SPRING","type":"ANIME","format":"TV","seasonYear":2026,"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/184492-JsZazzn4Acqf.jpg","episodes":24,"synonyms":["อิรุมะคุง ผจญในแดนปีศาจ ซีซั่น 4"],"isAdult":false,"countryOfOrigin":"JP","meanScore":81,"description":"The fourth season of \u003ci\u003eMairimashita! Iruma-kun.\u003c/i\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nSuzuki Iruma and all thirteen students of the Misfit Class must perform to reach Rank 4 at the Music Festival.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Crunchyroll News)","genres":["Comedy","Fantasy","Supernatural"],"duration":25,"trailer":{"id":"6Lo1DUCY9nY","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/6Lo1DUCY9nY/hqdefault.jpg"},"title":{"english":"Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun Season 4","native":"魔入りました！入間くん 第4シリーズ","romaji":"Mairimashita! Iruma-kun 4","userPreferred":"Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun Season 4"},"coverImage":{"color":"#f1bb28","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx184492-KUVFGieuMaOx.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx184492-KUVFGieuMaOx.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx184492-KUVFGieuMaOx.jpg"},"startDate":{"day":4,"month":4,"year":2026},"endDate":{},"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1784366760,"episode":16,"timeUntilAiring":566283}}},"updated_at":"2026-07-12T01:37:57.478653518+05:30"},"189987":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/189987-0UGf5F7zWNvv.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e4c950","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx189987-CkTDPfD7vu2Y.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx189987-CkTDPfD7vu2Y.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx189987-CkTDPfD7vu2Y.jpg"},"description":"Sakuradaimon is the school's prefect. A prefect is a student who is authorized to enforce discipline. As a prefect, he's supposed to be a role model to other students, but unfortunately he's not perfect. Kohinata is one of the people who Sakuradaimon has tried to discipline into wearing appropriate school attire, but she has thusfar been disobedient.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\nAnd so this is a story of the two interacting with one another.","duration":24,"endDate":{},"episodes":12,"format":"TV","genres":["Comedy","Romance","Slice of Life"],"id":189987,"idMal":61425,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":75,"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1782138240,"episode":12,"timeUntilAiring":583406},"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2026,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/189987","startDate":{"day":6,"month":4,"year":2026},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":["The Story Between a Dumb Prefect and a High School Girl with an Inappropriate Skirt Length","PonSuka","ポンスカ","Бесполезный дежурный и школьница со слишком короткой юбкой"],"title":{"english":"The Klutzy Class Monitor and the Girl with the Short Skirt","native":"ポンコツ風紀委員とスカート丈が不適切なJKの話","romaji":"Ponkotsu Fuuki Iin to Skirt take ga Futekisetsu na JK no Hanashi","userPreferred":"The Klutzy Class Monitor and the Girl with the Short Skirt"},"trailer":{"id":"jrWzZGBwWBQ","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/jrWzZGBwWBQ/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T01:50:34.603714579+05:30"},"195600":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/195600-UxHvDXwzJxlP.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e49335","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx195600-moI0UFArtOme.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx195600-moI0UFArtOme.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx195600-moI0UFArtOme.jpg"},"description":"In a remote mountain village under the watchful eyes of two stone guardians, the young Yuru contentedly lives off the land while staying close to the only family he has left—Asa, his precious twin sister. Asa, meanwhile, carries out a mysterious “duty” on behalf of the village while locked in a cage. Why is Asa a prisoner? And what other secrets does Yuru’s otherwise idyllic home hide?\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e(Source: Square Enix)","duration":24,"endDate":{},"episodes":24,"format":"TV","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy","Supernatural"],"id":195600,"idMal":62001,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":78,"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1783175400,"episode":13,"timeUntilAiring":1037176},"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2026,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/195600","startDate":{"day":4,"month":4,"year":2026},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":["ヨミツガ","YomiTsuga","Pasangan dari Alam Baka","ยมลแห่งยมโลก","Daemons do Reino das Sombras","Espíritus del Inframundo"],"title":{"english":"Daemons of the Shadow Realm","native":"黄泉のツガイ","romaji":"Yomi no Tsugai","userPreferred":"Daemons of the Shadow Realm"},"trailer":{"id":"XCyj9KKKjUI","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/XCyj9KKKjUI/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-22T19:53:45.000898578+05:30"},"196017":{"value":{"Media":{"id":196017,"idMal":62051,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/196017","status":"RELEASING","season":"SUMMER","type":"ANIME","format":"TV","seasonYear":2026,"isAdult":false,"countryOfOrigin":"JP","meanScore":72,"description":"The anime's story is set in the late 1950s and early 1960s, during the height of Japan's economic boom, when the circus is a major form of entertainment. Different circus troupes travel throughout Japan to perform and compete for a chance to participate in the world-renowned festival called \"Circus Collection.\" One troupe called the \"Sunflower Circus,\" led by its ringmaster Maria, travels around Japan to perform, despite struggling with financial difficulties. However, they meet a circus prodigy named Mizuka Tsurumaki. This is the story of a one-of-a-kind circus show of young girls with big dreams.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Anime News Network)","duration":24,"trailer":{"id":"PAneuhZLHzU","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/PAneuhZLHzU/hqdefault.jpg"},"title":{"english":"Grow Up Show","native":"グロウアップショウ ～ひまわりのサーカス団～","romaji":"Grow Up Show: Himawari no Circus-dan","userPreferred":"Grow Up Show"},"coverImage":{"color":"#f1ae1a","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx196017-GynDNdbDzqzk.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx196017-GynDNdbDzqzk.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx196017-GynDNdbDzqzk.jpg"},"startDate":{"day":5,"month":7,"year":2026},"endDate":{},"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1784386800,"episode":3,"timeUntilAiring":577423}}},"updated_at":"2026-07-12T04:06:17.543110836+05:30"},"196187":{"value":{"Media":{"id":196187,"idMal":62076,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/196187","status":"RELEASING","season":"SUMMER","type":"ANIME","format":"TV","seasonYear":2026,"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/196187-Z9dV6uotmKjM.jpg","episodes":12,"synonyms":["Behind the supermarket, smoking with you.","ヤニすう","YaniSuu","Paląc z tobą na tyłach sklepu","สองสิงห์อมควันหลังซูเปอร์มาร์เก็ต"],"isAdult":false,"countryOfOrigin":"JP","meanScore":83,"description":"At age forty-five, office worker Sasaki has had enough of the corporate grind. His only solace is smoking-and the friendly smile of supermarket cashier Yamada. When Sasaki can't find Yamada after a particularly trying day, a striking woman invites him to smoke with her. The despondent man thinks he's made a new smoking buddy in the cool, teasing Tayama, but Sasaki doesn't realize he already knows her!\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Square Enix)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\n\u003ci\u003eNote: Episodes 1-6 had an early release by ABEMA and Crunchyroll on June 3rd, 2026 in a mini-episode batch format that splits 6 episodes into 12, ahead of the TV broadcast which started on July 9th, 2026.\u003c/i\u003e","genres":["Comedy","Romance","Slice of Life"],"duration":24,"trailer":{"id":"aOOwNK6Ul6E","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/aOOwNK6Ul6E/hqdefault.jpg"},"title":{"english":"Smoking Behind the Supermarket with You","native":"スーパーの裏でヤニ吸うふたり","romaji":"Super no Ura de Yani Suu Futari","userPreferred":"Smoking Behind the Supermarket with You"},"coverImage":{"color":"#f1c9bb","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx196187-0dgFi2CPp3xn.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx196187-0dgFi2CPp3xn.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx196187-0dgFi2CPp3xn.jpg"},"startDate":{"day":9,"month":7,"year":2026},"endDate":{},"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1784213760,"episode":2,"timeUntilAiring":413284}}},"updated_at":"2026-07-12T01:37:56.877480015+05:30"},"19815":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/19815-BqbuD0wyBS3P.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#f1a135","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b19815-sEOQ9yQaPKlk.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b19815-sEOQ9yQaPKlk.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b19815-sEOQ9yQaPKlk.jpg"},"description":"Bored with life and considering the real world to be just a “crappy game,” savvy sibling shut-ins Sora and Shiro have withdrawn into their own fantasy world filled with video games. \n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nHowever, one day they find themselves summoned to another world by a boy who calls himself “God,” their abilities are about to be put to the ultimate test! Now not only their fates — but the fate of all of humanity — will be decided by a series of games that may just be the hardest these super-geniuses have ever faced!\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks, edited)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":25,"month":6,"year":2014},"episodes":12,"format":"TV","genres":["Adventure","Comedy","Ecchi","Fantasy"],"id":19815,"idMal":19815,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":77,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2014,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/19815","startDate":{"day":9,"month":4,"year":2014},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["NGNL","NO GAME NO LIFE游戏人生","游戏人生","โนเกม โนไลฟ์","遊戲人生","NO GAME NO LIFE 遊戲人生","nogenora ","ノゲノラ"],"title":{"english":"No Game, No Life","native":"ノーゲーム・ノーライフ","romaji":"No Game No Life","userPreferred":"No Game, No Life"},"trailer":{"id":"TqMCYf1FibU","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/TqMCYf1FibU/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T01:56:01.875182018+05:30"},"199748":{"value":{"Media":{"id":199748,"idMal":62617,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/199748","status":"RELEASING","season":"SUMMER","type":"ANIME","format":"ONA","seasonYear":2026,"episodes":12,"synonyms":["KokoOre","ここ俺"],"isAdult":false,"countryOfOrigin":"JP","meanScore":68,"description":"Luck, an S-rank mage in the hero’s party, makes a last stand against the Demon King to save his companions. When he finally returns victorious, ten years have passed, and the world praises him as a legendary hero who died in battle. Unable to reclaim his former life, Luck conceals his identity and begins again as “Lock,” an F-rank adventurer forging a future in a world that moved on without him.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Crunchyroll)\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\n\u003ci\u003eNote: Koko wa Ore ni Makasete Saki ni Ike to Ittekara 10-nen ga Tattara Densetsu ni Natteita is streaming 3 days in advance of the TV broadcast on Prime Video beginning July 3rd, 2026. Regular broadcasting began on July 6th, 2026.\u003c/i\u003e","genres":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy"],"duration":23,"trailer":{"id":"_9FRdFYJOdg","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_9FRdFYJOdg/hqdefault.jpg"},"title":{"english":"I Became a Legend After My 10 Year-Long Last Stand","native":"ここは俺に任せて先に行けと言ってから１０年がたったら伝説になっていた。","romaji":"Koko wa Ore ni Makasete Saki ni Ike to Ittekara 10-nen ga Tattara Densetsu ni Natteita.","userPreferred":"I Became a Legend After My 10 Year-Long Last Stand"},"coverImage":{"color":"#5dd6f1","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx199748-PAFk9pGSUmFL.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx199748-PAFk9pGSUmFL.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx199748-PAFk9pGSUmFL.png"},"startDate":{"day":3,"month":7,"year":2026},"endDate":{},"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1784295000,"episode":3,"timeUntilAiring":496564}}},"updated_at":"2026-07-12T01:03:56.267324722+05:30"},"20602":{"value":{"Media":{"id":20602,"idMal":22147,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/20602","status":"FINISHED","season":"FALL","type":"ANIME","format":"TV","seasonYear":2014,"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20602-HrakjBfgWeRg.jpg","episodes":13,"synonyms":["Amaburi","甘ブリ","Cudowny park Amagi"],"isAdult":false,"countryOfOrigin":"JP","meanScore":72,"description":"When new transfer student Isuzu asks Seiya Kanie out on a date at gunpoint, he knows something odd is going on. Especially since she wants to go to Amagi Brilliant Park, where the rides are either dangerous or mind-numbingly dull and the only costumed performers who aren’t rude or apathetic are the ones who didn’t show up for work.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\nSo when Isuzu asks Seiya to take over as the park’s new manager, he knows she’s crazy (Well, crazy-er, given the gunpoint thing.).  But when Seiya learns that Amagi Brilliant Park is a REAL Magic Kingdom, that the costumed performers aren’t wearing costumes, that they live off the energy created by attendees, and that unless they can attract 250,000 attendees in three months, they’ll lose their jobs and homes… he goes a little crazy himself.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\nBut, even with the aid of scantily clad fairies, giant mice and sniper-trained sheep, can anyone rescue a park that’s sunk so low that its own bus doesn’t stop there anymore? The race is on to get the turnstiles turning and save Amagi Brilliant Park!\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)","genres":["Comedy","Fantasy"],"duration":24,"trailer":{"id":"WGMLDSTkvDo","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/WGMLDSTkvDo/hqdefault.jpg"},"title":{"english":"Amagi Brilliant Park","native":"甘城ブリリアントパーク","romaji":"Amagi Brilliant Park","userPreferred":"Amagi Brilliant Park"},"coverImage":{"color":"#e4ae50","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx20602-f6CfipBF44kV.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx20602-f6CfipBF44kV.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx20602-f6CfipBF44kV.png"},"startDate":{"day":7,"month":10,"year":2014},"endDate":{"day":26,"month":12,"year":2014}}},"updated_at":"2026-07-12T02:20:15.694417116+05:30"},"206914":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/206914-owssGq2CGhRZ.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#35c9e4","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx206914-SHKX08LarRzB.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx206914-SHKX08LarRzB.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx206914-SHKX08LarRzB.jpg"},"description":"A revolution sparked by nuclear war, natural disaster, and misrule leads to the collapse of Japanese society. The country splits into three nations vying for hegemony, and the Sangoku era begins. Aoteru Misumi, a former agricultural officer, vows to reunify Japan. He rises through the ranks with only his knowledge and eloquence. Witness the legend of the man later hailed as a genius strategist.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Amazon Prime Video)","endDate":{"day":21,"month":6,"year":2026},"episodes":12,"format":"ONA","genres":["Action","Drama","Sci-Fi"],"id":206914,"idMal":63375,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":82,"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1782043200,"episode":12,"timeUntilAiring":488571},"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2026,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/206914","startDate":{"day":5,"month":4,"year":2026},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":["Nippon Sangoku: Trzy Narody Wschodzącego Słońca","Les Nations du Soleil Sanglant","NIPPON SANGOKU: สามก๊กญี่ปุ่น","Nippon Sangoku: A Guerra das Três Nações","NIPPON SANGOKU: Kızıl Güneşin Üç Ulusu","Nippon Sangoku: Las tres naciones del sol carmesí"],"title":{"english":"NIPPON SANGOKU: The Three Nations of the Crimson Sun","native":"日本三國","romaji":"Nippon Sangoku","userPreferred":"NIPPON SANGOKU: The Three Nations of the Crimson Sun"},"trailer":{"id":"PvjwzkcaT2Y","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/PvjwzkcaT2Y/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T01:47:09.285088169+05:30"},"20789":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20789-qwG9GcxIrmVE.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e4861a","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx20789-Ma5ouSYPkru9.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx20789-Ma5ouSYPkru9.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx20789-Ma5ouSYPkru9.jpg"},"description":"When they were accused of trying to overthrow the monarchy, the feared warriors the Seven Deadly Sins were sent into exile. Princess Elizabeth discovers the truth - the Sins were framed by the king's guard, the Holy Knights - too late to prevent them from assassinating her father and seizing the throne!\u003cbr\u003e\nNow the princess is on the run, seeking the Sins to help her reclaim the kingdom. But the first Sin she meets, Meliodas, is a little innkeeper with a talking pig. He doesn't even have a real sword! Have the legends of the Sins' strength been exaggerated?\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Anime News Network)","duration":25,"endDate":{"day":29,"month":3,"year":2015},"episodes":24,"format":"TV","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Ecchi","Fantasy","Supernatural"],"id":20789,"idMal":23755,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":73,"season":"FALL","seasonYear":2014,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/20789","startDate":{"day":5,"month":10,"year":2014},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["七大罪","ศึกตำนาน 7 อัศวิน","7DS","Семь смертных грехов"],"title":{"english":"The Seven Deadly Sins","native":"七つの大罪","romaji":"Nanatsu no Taizai","userPreferred":"The Seven Deadly Sins"},"trailer":{"id":"wxcvbL6o55M","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/wxcvbL6o55M/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T02:54:18.804702636+05:30"},"20807":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20807-IHYC4Qby3dkT.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx20807-8nFoO0AUdGsy.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx20807-8nFoO0AUdGsy.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx20807-8nFoO0AUdGsy.jpg"},"description":"Hachimitsu Private Academy was a revered and elite all-girls' boarding school on the outskirts of Tokyo...once upon a time. But with the new school year comes a revision to school policy: Boys are to be admitted into the student body for the first time ever. But on his first day at Hachimitsu, Kiyoshi Fujino discovers that he's one of only five boys enrolled at the school. Their numbers overwhelmed by the thousand girls in the student body, is it heaven or hell that awaits these five (un)fortunates?!.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Anime News Network)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":26,"month":9,"year":2015},"episodes":12,"format":"TV","genres":["Comedy","Ecchi"],"id":20807,"idMal":30240,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":73,"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2015,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/20807","startDate":{"day":11,"month":7,"year":2015},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["โรงเรียนคุกนรก","Kangoku Gakuen"],"title":{"english":"Prison School","native":"監獄学園〈プリズンスクール〉","romaji":"Prison School","userPreferred":"Prison School"},"trailer":{"id":"HSvlOPMLQFQ","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/HSvlOPMLQFQ/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T02:26:41.265864215+05:30"},"20892":{"value":{"Media":{"countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e4c95d","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/20892.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/20892.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/20892.jpg"},"description":"Gal game animation specials included in DVD/Blu-ray Vol.8.","duration":22,"endDate":{"day":22,"month":1,"year":2014},"episodes":2,"format":"SPECIAL","genres":["Comedy","Ecchi","Romance"],"id":20892,"idMal":23363,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":61,"season":"WINTER","seasonYear":2014,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/20892","startDate":{"day":22,"month":1,"year":2014},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["My Little Sister Can't Be This Cute 2: Gal Game Animation","Oreimo 2: Gal Game Animation","Oreimo 2: Galge-Style Animation"],"title":{"english":"Oreimo 2: My Little Sister Can't Be This Eroge","native":"俺の妹がこんなにエロゲーなわけがない～逆襲の秋美～　初詣編＆バレンタイン編","romaji":"Ore no Imouto ga Konna ni Kawaii Wake ga Nai. Gal Game Animation","userPreferred":"Oreimo 2: My Little Sister Can't Be This Eroge"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T01:49:58.656540806+05:30"},"20923":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20923-9tFdZ5hIrRiF.png","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e4935d","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx20923-pNT38pjW3RFH.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx20923-pNT38pjW3RFH.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx20923-pNT38pjW3RFH.jpg"},"description":"Ever since he was little, Souma Yukihira’s main goals have been to beat his father in a cooking contest and take over the family diner. That’s why, when his dad suddenly announces that he’s shutting the restaurant down and sending Souma to cooking school, Souma is shocked. However, Totsuki Academy is no ordinary cooking school. This elite institution is filled with culinary giants like Erina “God Tongue” Nakiri, who does her best to keep a lowly short-order like Souma from even making it inside the door. However, if the snobs can dish it out, Souma can serve it up, and when he learns that only a handful of the students manage to graduate every year, he swears that the only way he’ll leave is as number one!\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)","duration":25,"endDate":{"day":26,"month":9,"year":2015},"episodes":24,"format":"TV","genres":["Comedy","Ecchi"],"id":20923,"idMal":28171,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":78,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2015,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/20923","startDate":{"day":4,"month":4,"year":2015},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["لا سلام على طعام","Food Wars! The First Plate","食戟之灵","ยอดนักปรุงโซมะ"],"title":{"english":"Food Wars!","native":"食戟のソーマ","romaji":"Shokugeki no Souma","userPreferred":"Food Wars!"},"trailer":{"id":"Ei7r95k5d_Q","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Ei7r95k5d_Q/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T01:55:59.339366988+05:30"},"21110":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21110-4aUSUXvAroiQ.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e45d50","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx21110-TxTB92HIRfMv.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx21110-TxTB92HIRfMv.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx21110-TxTB92HIRfMv.jpg"},"description":"The second season of \u003ci\u003eShinmai Maou no Testament\u003c/i\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\nAfter two demon girls, Maria the succubus and Mio the demoness, force Basara into a contract that makes him their master, the trio form a complicated master-servant relationship. Basara is the last descendant of a demon-fighting hero clan, but as master of two demon girls, he finds himself defending them instead of fighting them.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Funimation)","duration":23,"endDate":{"day":12,"month":12,"year":2015},"episodes":10,"format":"TV","genres":["Action","Ecchi","Fantasy","Romance"],"id":21110,"idMal":30363,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":65,"season":"FALL","seasonYear":2015,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/21110","startDate":{"day":10,"month":10,"year":2015},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["Shinmai Maou no Keiyakusha BURST"],"title":{"english":"The Testament of Sister New Devil BURST","native":"新妹魔王の契約者 BURST","romaji":"Shinmai Maou no Testament: BURST","userPreferred":"The Testament of Sister New Devil BURST"},"trailer":{"id":"4f5cBYUZmT0","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/4f5cBYUZmT0/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T01:49:46.682508356+05:30"},"21399":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21399-vCKFTNkrYLIz.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#28aee4","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx21399-VTAdAqc8u5AE.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx21399-VTAdAqc8u5AE.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx21399-VTAdAqc8u5AE.png"},"description":"First season of the Monogatari Series, part 3/6. Contains the arc Koyomi Vamp from the Kizumonogatari light novel.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nIn the spring of his second year of high school, Koyomi Araragi met the beautiful vampire Kiss-Shot Acerola-Orion Heart-Under-Blade. Koyomi saved Kiss-shot, who was on the verge of death with all four of her limbs cut off, but only at the expense of becoming her minion and a vampire. “In order to go back to being a human again, you must take back all of Kiss-shot’s limbs.” After receiving advice from Meme Oshino, an expert in the supernatural, Koyomi prepares to go into battle.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nAwaiting him are three powerful vampire hunters—Dramaturgy, a giant vampire hunter who is a vampire himself. Episode, a half-vampire who wields an enormous cross, and Guillotinecutter, a quiet man who specializes in killing vampires. Will Koyomi be able to take back Kiss-Shot’s limbs from the vampire hunters? Amidst the soft spring rain, the curtain rises on this fateful blood bath…\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Aniplex)","duration":68,"endDate":{"day":19,"month":8,"year":2016},"episodes":1,"format":"MOVIE","genres":["Action","Drama","Ecchi","Mystery","Psychological","Supernatural"],"id":21399,"idMal":31757,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":85,"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2016,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/21399","startDate":{"day":19,"month":8,"year":2016},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["Wound Tale 2: Hot Blood"],"title":{"english":"Kizumonogatari Part 2: Nekketsu","native":"傷物語〈Ⅱ熱血篇〉","romaji":"Kizumonogatari II: Nekketsu-hen","userPreferred":"Kizumonogatari Part 2: Nekketsu"},"trailer":{"id":"nOiEjQy-J7U","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/nOiEjQy-J7U/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T01:55:57.936333831+05:30"},"21400":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21400-5zcYUeVBptdG.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e4d628","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx21400-38ykNo3j4xXo.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx21400-38ykNo3j4xXo.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx21400-38ykNo3j4xXo.png"},"description":"First season of the Monogatari Series, part 4/6. Contains the arc Koyomi Vamp from the Kizumonogatari light novel.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nWith help from Meme Oshino, the apparition specialist, Koyomi defeats the three powerful vampire hunters: Dramaturgy, Episode and Guillotinecutter. Koyomi takes back all the limbs of Kiss-Shot Acerola-Orion Heart-Under-Blade in order to become a human again. But, when he returns to Kiss-Shot, she reveals to him the cold truth of what it means to be a vampire—a creature of the night. Unable to take back what he has done, Koyomi feels nothing but regret and can only deny his dreadful fate. While Koyomi is struggling to face reality, his “friend” Tsubasa Hanekawa comes to him with a certain plan…\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Aniplex)","duration":82,"endDate":{"day":6,"month":1,"year":2017},"episodes":1,"format":"MOVIE","genres":["Action","Drama","Ecchi","Mystery","Psychological","Supernatural"],"id":21400,"idMal":31758,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":87,"season":"WINTER","seasonYear":2017,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/21400","startDate":{"day":6,"month":1,"year":2017},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["Wound Tale 3: Cold Blood"],"title":{"english":"Kizumonogatari Part 3: Reiketsu","native":"傷物語〈Ⅲ冷血篇〉","romaji":"Kizumonogatari III: Reiketsu-hen","userPreferred":"Kizumonogatari Part 3: Reiketsu"},"trailer":{"id":"4nTLr6Uf9Ug","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/4nTLr6Uf9Ug/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T02:26:47.627012411+05:30"},"21699":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21699-1PwL1P4i61wP.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#f1a150","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx21699-Fkbnkl9ZC6fW.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx21699-Fkbnkl9ZC6fW.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx21699-Fkbnkl9ZC6fW.png"},"description":"When Kazuma Satou died, he was given two choices: pass on to heaven or be revived in a fantasy world. After choosing the new world, the goddess Aqua tasked him with defeating the Demon King, and let him choose any weapon to aid him. Unfortunately, Kazuma chose to bring Aqua herself and has regretted the decision ever since then.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nNot only is he stuck with a useless deity turned party archpriest, the pair also has to make enough money for living expenses. To add to their problems, their group continued to grow as more problematic adventurers joined their ranks. Their token spellcaster, Megumin, is an explosion magic specialist who can only cast one spell once per day and refuses to learn anything else. There is also their stalwart crusader, Lalatina \"Darkness\" Dustiness Ford, a helpless masochist who makes Kazuma look pure in comparison.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003ci\u003eKono Subarashii Sekai ni Shukufuku wo! 2\u003c/i\u003e continues to follow Kazuma and the rest of his party through countless more adventures as they struggle to earn money and have to deal with one another's problematic personalities. However, things rarely go as planned, and they are often sidetracked by their own idiotic tendencies.\n","duration":23,"endDate":{"day":16,"month":3,"year":2017},"episodes":10,"format":"TV","genres":["Adventure","Comedy","Ecchi","Fantasy"],"id":21699,"idMal":32937,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":81,"season":"WINTER","seasonYear":2017,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/21699","startDate":{"day":12,"month":1,"year":2017},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["Konosuba 2","Konosuba! - As Bençãos de Deus Neste Mundo Maravilhoso 2!","为美好的世界献上祝福！2","为美好的世界献上祝福第二季","ขอให้โชคดีมีชัยในโลกแฟนตาซี! ภาค 2","Konosuba : Une explosion dans ce monde merveilleux !","Да благословят боги сей расчудесный мир! 2","Konosuba! Un mundo maravilloso 2"],"title":{"english":"KONOSUBA -God's blessing on this wonderful world! 2","native":"この素晴らしい世界に祝福を！2","romaji":"Kono Subarashii Sekai ni Shukufuku wo! 2","userPreferred":"KONOSUBA -God's blessing on this wonderful world! 2"},"trailer":{"id":"9jVxMt845AY","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9jVxMt845AY/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T02:54:18.701006937+05:30"},"427":{"value":{"Media":{"id":427,"idMal":427,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/427","status":"FINISHED","season":"SPRING","type":"ANIME","format":"TV","seasonYear":2003,"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/427-JGvVUBiJTgWY.jpg","episodes":51,"synonyms":["Kaleido Star: New Wings","カレイドスター 新たなる翼","Kaleido Star: Aratanaru Tsubasa"],"isAdult":false,"countryOfOrigin":"JP","meanScore":76,"description":"Sora, a young girl from Japan, comes to America in search of her dream. She wants, with all her heart, to be a member of the Kaleido Stage, a world famous circus, with a combination of musicals, acrobatics and magical effects. With the help of her friends, she struggles to make this dream come true.","genres":["Comedy","Drama","Sports","Supernatural"],"duration":23,"title":{"english":"Kaleido Star","native":"カレイドスター","romaji":"Kaleido Star","userPreferred":"Kaleido Star"},"coverImage":{"color":"#5daef1","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx427-nzHOyyTX2jLO.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx427-nzHOyyTX2jLO.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx427-nzHOyyTX2jLO.jpg"},"startDate":{"day":3,"month":4,"year":2003},"endDate":{"day":27,"month":3,"year":2004}}},"updated_at":"2026-07-12T02:20:16.476883503+05:30"},"430":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/430-G07rfvPsD2Zg.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e4bb5d","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/nx430-Fx7lVxpcwArH.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/nx430-Fx7lVxpcwArH.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx430-Fx7lVxpcwArH.jpg"},"description":"Munich, Germany, 1923. Two years have passed since Edward Elric was dragged from his own world to ours, leaving behind his country, his friends and his younger brother, Alphonse. Stripped of his alchemical powers, he has been all this time researching rocketry together with Alphonse Heiderich, a young man who resembles his own brother, hoping to one day find a way back home. His efforts so far had proven fruitless, but after lending a hand to a troubled gypsy girl, Edward is thrown in a series of events that can wreak havoc in both worlds. Meanwhile, at his own world, Alphonse Elric ventures deeper into the mysteries of alchemy in search for a way to reunite with his older brother.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Anime News Network)","duration":105,"endDate":{"day":23,"month":7,"year":2005},"episodes":1,"format":"MOVIE","genres":["Action","Comedy","Drama","Fantasy"],"id":430,"idMal":430,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":71,"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2005,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/430","startDate":{"day":23,"month":7,"year":2005},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["Gekijyouban Hagane no Renkinjutsushi - Shanbara wo Yuku Mono","Fullmetal Alchemist the Movie: Conqueror of Shamballa","Fullmetal Alchemist: The Conqueror of Shamballa","แขนกลคนแปรธาตุ เดอะมูฟวี่ฝ่ามิติพิชิตแดนสวรรค์","Giả kim thuật sư: Người chinh phục Shamballa","FMA Movie"],"title":{"english":"Fullmetal Alchemist: The Movie - Conqueror of Shamballa","native":"鋼の錬金術師 シャンバラを征く者","romaji":"Hagane no Renkinjutsushi: Shamballa wo Yuku Mono","userPreferred":"Fullmetal Alchemist: The Movie - Conqueror of Shamballa"},"trailer":{"id":"9M49TDkY46s","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9M49TDkY46s/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T01:49:16.67600085+05:30"},"5781":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/5781-xCge00jLxES5.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#d6e486","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx5781-35eEKnvpvri8.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx5781-35eEKnvpvri8.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx5781-35eEKnvpvri8.jpg"},"description":"Kenshi \u0026mdash;half-brother of intergalactic hero Tenchi Masaki\u0026mdash; has been summoned to the mysterious world of Geminar, and his only hope of returning to Earth is piloting a bio-mechanical weapon in a shocking assassination attempt! When the mission fails and Kenshi is captured, he discovers he's been lied to by the very culprits who transported him to this strange new world. Luckily, Princess Lashara kindly welcomes Kenshi and invites him to live amongst her followers. Now, caught up in a political whirlwind \u0026mdash;and hotly pursued by Geminar's female population\u0026mdash; Kenshi must find a way to get home while civil war erupts all around him! \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: FUNimation) ","duration":45,"endDate":{"day":19,"month":3,"year":2010},"episodes":13,"format":"OVA","genres":["Action","Comedy","Ecchi","Fantasy","Mecha"],"id":5781,"idMal":5781,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":74,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2009,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/5781","startDate":{"day":20,"month":3,"year":2009},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["ISM"],"title":{"english":"Tenchi Muyo! War on Geminar","native":"異世界の聖機師物語","romaji":"Isekai no Seikishi Monogatari","userPreferred":"Tenchi Muyo! War on Geminar"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T02:26:41.263677483+05:30"},"9253":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n9253-JIhmKgBKsWUN.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#ffd6ae","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx9253-tIUXF2gfU8Sg.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx9253-tIUXF2gfU8Sg.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx9253-tIUXF2gfU8Sg.jpg"},"description":"Self-proclaimed mad scientist Okabe Rintarou lives in a small room in Akihabara, where he invents \"future gadgets\" with fellow lab members Shiina Mayuri, his air-headed childhood friend, and Hashida Itaru, an otaku hacker. The three pass the time by tinkering with their latest creation, a \"Phone Microwave\" that can be controlled through text messages. \n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nThe lab members soon face a string of mysterious incidents that lead to a game-changing discovery: the Phone Microwave can send emails to the past and thus alter history. Adapted from the critically acclaimed visual novel by 5pb. and Nitroplus, Steins;Gate takes Okabe to the depths of scientific theory and human despair as he faces the dire consequences of changing the past.","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":14,"month":9,"year":2011},"episodes":24,"format":"TV","genres":["Drama","Psychological","Sci-Fi","Thriller"],"id":9253,"idMal":9253,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":89,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2011,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/9253","startDate":{"day":6,"month":4,"year":2011},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["S;G","סטיינס;גייט","命运石之门","Врата;Штейна"],"title":{"english":"Steins;Gate","native":"シュタインズ・ゲート","romaji":"Steins;Gate","userPreferred":"Steins;Gate"},"trailer":{"id":"27OZc-ku6is","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/27OZc-ku6is/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T01:48:04.54956104+05:30"},"9751":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/9751-Ay33wplrvqbc.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#5d86e4","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx9751-HZPD9Jz8pK12.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx9751-HZPD9Jz8pK12.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx9751-HZPD9Jz8pK12.jpg"},"description":"In 1945, Yoshika Miyafuji, who lost her witch powers during the Strike Witches' last assignment, has been studying to become a doctor. Shizuka Hattori, one of her cadets in the Imperial Fuso Navy, then arrives to deliver a message: Yoshika is to be transferred for study abroad in Europe. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nWhen their enemy reappears more powerful than ever, the Strike Witches must form up once again. But can they do it without Yoshika Miyafuji?\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Kadokawa, Crunchyroll) ","duration":97,"endDate":{"day":17,"month":3,"year":2012},"episodes":1,"format":"MOVIE","genres":["Action","Ecchi","Sci-Fi"],"id":9751,"idMal":9751,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":74,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2012,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/9751","startDate":{"day":17,"month":3,"year":2012},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["强袭魔女 剧场版"],"title":{"english":"Strike Witches: The Movie","native":"ストライクウィッチーズ 劇場版","romaji":"Strike Witches Movie","userPreferred":"Strike Witches: The Movie"},"trailer":{"id":"A-KSZ_OaFZg","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/A-KSZ_OaFZg/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T02:17:55.141498976+05:30"},"98478":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/98478-BDH64RDmBlr8.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#ffc993","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx98478-Yua5iL9zbrji.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx98478-Yua5iL9zbrji.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx98478-Yua5iL9zbrji.jpg"},"description":"The second season of \u003ci\u003e3-gatsu no Lion\u003c/i\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\nNow in his second year of high school, Rei Kiriyama continues pushing through his struggles in the professional shogi world as well as his personal life. Surrounded by vibrant personalities at the shogi hall, the school club, and in the local community, his solitary shell slowly begins to crack. Among them are the three Kawamoto sisters—Akari, Hinata, and Momo—who forge an affectionate and familial bond with Rei. Through these ties, he realizes that everyone is burdened by their own emotional hardships and begins learning how to rely on others while supporting them in return.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\nNonetheless, the life of a professional is not easy. Between tournaments, championships, and title matches, the pressure mounts as Rei advances through the ranks and encounters incredibly skilled opponents. As he manages his relationships with those who have grown close to him, the shogi player continues to search for the reason he plays the game that defines his career.\n","duration":25,"endDate":{"day":31,"month":3,"year":2018},"episodes":22,"format":"TV","genres":["Drama","Slice of Life"],"id":98478,"idMal":35180,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":89,"season":"FALL","seasonYear":2017,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/98478","startDate":{"day":14,"month":10,"year":2017},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["Sangatsu no Lion 2","מרץ מגיע כאריה 2"],"title":{"english":"March comes in like a lion Season 2","native":"３月のライオン 第2シリーズ","romaji":"3-gatsu no Lion 2nd Season","userPreferred":"March comes in like a lion Season 2"},"trailer":{"id":"OfSaJb5OOPA","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/OfSaJb5OOPA/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T01:48:16.665565391+05:30"},"99539":{"value":{"Media":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/99539-ermF56v2Gz2p.png","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#ffe435","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx99539-caPX28RSsgRP.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx99539-caPX28RSsgRP.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx99539-caPX28RSsgRP.jpg"},"description":"Melodias, Hawk, and Elizabeth retook the Kingdom of Leones from the Holy Knights. The festival went off without a hitch and the crew enjoyed their well-earned peace. And yet, another threat looms on the horizon. The Ten Commandments, a group of elite demon clan warriors, have their sights set on the kingdom.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Anime News Network)","duration":25,"endDate":{"day":30,"month":6,"year":2018},"episodes":24,"format":"TV","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Ecchi","Fantasy","Supernatural"],"id":99539,"idMal":34577,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":73,"season":"WINTER","seasonYear":2018,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/99539","startDate":{"day":13,"month":1,"year":2018},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["The Seven Deadly Sins: Die Rückkehr der Gebote","ศึกตำนาน 7 อัศวิน ภาค 2 คืนชีพบัญญัติสิบประการ","The Seven Deadly Sins: Odrodzenie przykazań","Семь смертных грехов: Возрождение Заповедей"],"title":{"english":"The Seven Deadly Sins: Revival of the Commandments","native":"七つの大罪 戒めの復活","romaji":"Nanatsu no Taizai: Imashime no Fukkatsu","userPreferred":"The Seven Deadly Sins: Revival of the Commandments"},"trailer":{"id":"ULP_6faadB4","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ULP_6faadB4/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T02:26:41.792181314+05:30"}}
